{
  "published": "2026-10-08",
  "title": "Forming a US Company in 2026: Costs and Changes",
  "meta_description": "Firstbase Start costs $99 under an offer plus a required $299-a-year agent. Stripe pays the $500 Atlas fee back for a $5,000 Treasury deposit. Delaware's LLC tax is $400.",
  "lead": "Firstbase Start costs $99 under a current offer (listed at $399), plus the state fee and a required registered agent at $299 a year. Stripe Atlas costs $500, including Delaware's filing fee and the first year of registered agent service, and Stripe pays the $500 back when the company deposits $5,000 in a Stripe Treasury account within 90 days of incorporating and keeps it there 30 days. No ZenBusiness package includes a registered agent. Delaware's annual LLC tax is $400 since 2026-01-01.",
  "read_line": "Prices read on each provider's own pages, and Delaware's and FinCEN's, on 2026-10-08.",
